# Lab 03 — Microsoft Entra ID Identity Investigation

## Overview

This operational lab investigates Microsoft Entra ID identities using the Azure Portal, Azure CLI, and Microsoft Graph.

Building on the previous identity and access management exercise, this lab focuses on validating tenant identity data, examining member and guest accounts, inspecting device inventory, and comparing portal configuration with command-line evidence.

The workflow reflects practical cloud administration and security investigation techniques.

## Objectives

* Review Azure role-based access control (RBAC) configuration.
* Validate Azure CLI authentication and subscription context.
* Query Microsoft Entra ID users through Microsoft Graph.
* Identify internal member and external guest identities.
* Inspect the tenant's registered device inventory.
* Compare identity information obtained through the portal and API.
* Document findings and environmental limitations.

