## Conclusion

This lab combined Azure Portal administration with Azure CLI and Microsoft Graph queries to investigate identity and access management in Microsoft Entra ID.

The exercise demonstrated authentication validation, user enumeration, member and guest identity analysis, device inventory inspection, and evidence-based documentation of environmental limitations.

It also reinforced the importance of distinguishing directory identity, Azure resource authorisation, and device registration when investigating cloud security configurations.

